In association with The University of New Mexico, I was asked to redesign the Department of Art website for a more user-friendly and navigatable experience on mobile and desktop.&#38;nbsp;

	&#60;img width="1920" height="1275" width_o="1920" height_o="1275" data-src="https://freight.cargo.site/t/original/i/d431521d38925dbea23d17ac51d91377927ccc91319f5df809aa071d6657a190/recipefordisaster.png" data-mid="132394096" border="0"  src="https://freight.cargo.site/w/1000/i/d431521d38925dbea23d17ac51d91377927ccc91319f5df809aa071d6657a190/recipefordisaster.png" /&#62;
	

	Art Exhibition Design
In association with CFA Downtown Studio located in Albuquerque, New Mexico I was in charge of Exhibition design for the art exhibition ‘Recipe for Disaster’. The bulk of the project included exhibition signage, wall vinyl, poster and postcard design, as well as the exhibition catalog design.

	&#60;img width="1920" height="1275" width_o="1920" height_o="1275" data-src="https://freight.cargo.site/t/original/i/f02ce849269d73aad382d156f23c8eda6f6db531330206c2860d2d78cc193ab7/weare.png" data-mid="132394494" border="0"  src="https://freight.cargo.site/w/1000/i/f02ce849269d73aad382d156f23c8eda6f6db531330206c2860d2d78cc193ab7/weare.png" /&#62;
	

